# Reference screenshots of third-party apps — this repo is public,
# and these carry other providers' branding. Keep them local.
docs/*.jpeg
docs/*.jpg
docs/*.png

# Tool output: QA reports and their screenshots. The screenshots show the
# panel's own posters and category names, which is exactly the provider-
# identifying material the rule above exists to keep out of a public repo.
# Findings live in TODOS.md instead.
.gstack/

